OL,5,G1130 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FEnvironmentally-friendly couple
OL,7,     FIan and Jayne host first, at The
OL,8,     FSchool House B&B in Pencader,
OL,9,     FCarmarthenshire. At dinner,
OL,10,     Feyebrows are raised at two
OL,11,     Fstraight-talking guests.
OL,12,G1200 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FNeil and Jo welcome their rivals
OL,14,     Fto Cathedral 73 in Cardiff. Their
OL,15,     Fguests are wowed by the glamorous
